---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>
      What a great place to live! | Christen Thompson for Heber City Council
    </title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen font-sans">
    <header class="bg-green-900 text-white py-6 shadow">
      <div
        class="container mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between px-4"
      >
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">
          <a href="/" class="hover:underline"
            >Christen Thompson for Heber City Council</a
          >
        </h1>
        <nav class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
          <a href="/" class="mr-6 hover:underline">Home</a>
          <a href="/about" class="mr-6 hover:underline">About</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="mr-6 hover:underline">Blog</a>
          <a href="/donate" class="hover:underline">Donate</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10 max-w-3xl">
      <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
        <header class="mb-8">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">What a great place to live!</h1>
          <time class="text-gray-600">Saturday, July 12th, 2025</time>
        </header>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="mb-4">
            Had a great ride this weekend on the Jordanelle Ridge! This is
            exactly why I'm running for city council - to help preserve and
            expand opportunities like this for everyone in Heber Valley.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
            <img
              src="/images/bikeride1.HEIC"
              alt="Bike ride on Jordanelle Ridge - View 1"
              class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-48 object-cover"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/bikeride2.HEIC"
              alt="Bike ride on Jordanelle Ridge - View 2"
              class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-48 object-cover"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/bikeride3.HEIC"
              alt="Bike ride on Jordanelle Ridge - View 3"
              class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-48 object-cover"
            />
          </div>

          <p class="mb-4">
            These trails and open spaces are what make Heber Valley special. We
            need to protect them and create more connections so everyone can
            enjoy the natural beauty that surrounds us.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-800">
              Related Trail Plans:
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li>
                <a
                  href="/pdfs/Heber Trails Master Plan Map 2023 (2).pdf"
                  class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline flex items-center"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  📄 Heber Trails Master Plan Map 2023
                </a>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a
                  href="/pdfs/Wasatch Trails Master Plan Map (4).pdf"
                  class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline flex items-center"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  📄 Wasatch Trails Master Plan Map
                </a>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a
                  href="/pdfs/Midway Master Trail Plan 22 (4).pdf"
                  class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline flex items-center"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  📄 Midway Master Trail Plan 2022
                </a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p class="mb-4">
            Thanks for reading this far. I would love to hear from you, you can
            text or call me at my google voice number (435) 315-2551 or email me
            at christen.thompson@gmail.com.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4"></p>
          <p class="mb-4"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
          <a href="/blog" class="text-green-700 hover:underline"
            >← Back to Blog</a
          >
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>
    <footer class="bg-green-900 text-white py-4 mt-10 text-center">
      &copy; 2025 Christen Thompson for Heber City Council
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
